# Ray reads this like .gitignore to filter files uploaded as working_dir.
# Strategy: exclude everything at the project root, then re-include only the
# directories Ray workers actually need to import.
# - ahb/: the new harness package (Ray trials launched by ahb/train.py).
# - model/: imported by the encoder yamls (!new: model.X.Y).
/*
!/ahb/
!/model/